Milestone 2 – Project Report
Project Title: Exam Question Generator with Automated Quality Check
Team Name: Zero Shot
Team ID: PE-B01-08
1. Project Overview
ExamForge is an AI-powered application that generates examination questions from uploaded study materials. It uses the Google Gemini API to generate questions based on the selected topic, difficulty level, and requested question types.
2. Technologies Used
•	Python
•	Streamlit
•	Google Gemini API
•	PyMuPDF
•	GitHub
•	Streamlit Community Cloud
3. Working Modules
1.	Document upload and text extraction (PDF and TXT).
2.	Input configuration for topic and difficulty.
3.	Prompt construction and refinement.
4.	AI-based question generation using Gemini.
5.	MCQ, True/False, and Short Answer generation.
6.	Mixed question-type generation.
7.	Automated rule-based question quality evaluation.
8.	Generated question display.
9.	Copy and download functionality.
4. Automated Quality Evaluation
The application evaluates generated questions using rule-based checks for:
•	Completeness
•	Format correctness
•	Source relevance
•	Clarity
•	Specificity
Each question receives a quality score out of 100.
5. Prototype
The application has been deployed using Streamlit Community Cloud.
Live Prototype: https://examforge.streamlit.app/
6. Conclusion
The project has progressed from its initial proposal into a working application that combines prompt engineering, AI-based question generation, document processing, and automated question quality assessment.

